        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b6fee985871268f23e54cff46ae5985cc017a4e8/models/2026-delphi10000-eohippus-angustidens-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L192-L210> .
